<title>USA: Healthcare Services completes buyback.</title>
<headline>Healthcare Services completes buyback.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON VALLEY, Pa. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Healthcare Services Group Inc said on Wednesday it completed its previously announced buyback of five percent of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company also said it has authorized the future purchase of up to 600,000 shares on the open market.</p>
<p>Healthcare Services closed on Wednesday at 11-3/8, down 1/2 on the day.</p>
